{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WreqE48yqrKhdgsVhuZ382","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# PENILAIAN PENGETAHUAN (Knowledge Assessment)\n2\t\n3\t**Kod:** IT-020-3:2013-C01/KA\n4\t**Kertas Warna:** MERAH JAMBU (Pink)\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t| | |\n9\t|---|---|\n10\t| **Kod Program / Programme Code** | IT-020-3:2013 |\n11\t| **Nama Program / Programme Name** | Computer System Operation (Operasi Sistem Komputer) |\n12\t| **Tahap / Level** | 3 |\n13\t| **No. dan Tajuk Unit Kompetensi** | CoCu 1: Computer System Set-up (Persediaan Sistem Komputer) |\n14\t| **Tempoh / Duration** | 1 hour 30 minutes |\n15\t| **Jumlah Markah / Total Marks** | 100 |\n16\t| **Markah Lulus / Pass Mark** | 60% (as per institutional and JPK requirements) |\n17\t\n18\t---\n19\t\n20\t## Arahan kepada Pelatih / Instructions to Trainee\n21\t\n22\t1. This paper consists of THREE (3) sections: A, B, and C.\n23\t2. Answer ALL questions in ALL sections.\n24\t3. Write your answers clearly in the answer booklet provided.\n25\t4. This is a CLOSED BOOK examination. No reference materials are permitted.\n26\t5. You may use a basic calculator if needed.\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t## Arahan kepada Pengajar / Instructions to Instructor\n31\t\n32\t- Distribute the question paper and answer booklet to each trainee.\n33\t- Allow exactly 1 hour 30 minutes for the examination.\n34\t- Collect all papers at the end of the allocated time.\n35\t- Mark using the answer scheme provided (separate document).\n36\t\n37\t---\n38\t\n39\t## BAHAGIAN A: SOALAN PELBAGAI PILIHAN / SECTION A: MULTIPLE CHOICE (30 marks)\n40\t\n41\tAnswer all 15 questions. Each question carries 2 marks. Circle the correct answer.\n42\t\n43\t**1.** The document that formally initiates a computer system set-up task is called a:\n44\t\n45\t- (a) Purchase order\n46\t- (b) Job request / work order\n47\t- (c) Delivery note\n48\t- (d) Invoice\n49\t\n50\t**2.** Which of the following is a correct ESD prevention measure?"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41856400-6278-4fe8-b4e8-d6ce57744942","uuid":"935d51f8-a599-4214-a41d-fcfeb2dc604f","timestamp":"2026-04-17T03:56:56.650Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\it-computer-system\\L3-C01\\KA.md","content":"# PENILAIAN PENGETAHUAN (Knowledge Assessment)\n\n**Kod:** IT-020-3:2013-C01/KA\n**Kertas Warna:** MERAH JAMBU (Pink)\n\n---\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Kod Program / Programme Code** | IT-020-3:2013 |\n| **Nama Program / Programme Name** | Computer System Operation (Operasi Sistem Komputer) |\n| **Tahap / Level** | 3 |\n| **No. dan Tajuk Unit Kompetensi** | CoCu 1: Computer System Set-up (Persediaan Sistem Komputer) |\n| **Tempoh / Duration** | 1 hour 30 minutes |\n| **Jumlah Markah / Total Marks** | 100 |\n| **Markah Lulus / Pass Mark** | 60% (as per institutional and JPK requirements) |\n\n---\n\n## Arahan kepada Pelatih / Instructions to Trainee\n\n1. This paper consists of THREE (3) sections: A, B, and C.\n2. Answer ALL questions in ALL sections.\n3. Write your answers clearly in the answer booklet provided.\n4. This is a CLOSED BOOK examination. No reference materials are permitted.\n5. You may use a basic calculator if needed.\n\n---\n\n## Arahan kepada Pengajar / Instructions to Instructor\n\n- Distribute the question paper and answer booklet to each trainee.\n- Allow exactly 1 hour 30 minutes for the examination.\n- Collect all papers at the end of the allocated time.\n- Mark using the answer scheme provided (separate document).\n\n---\n\n## BAHAGIAN A: SOALAN PELBAGAI PILIHAN / SECTION A: MULTIPLE CHOICE (30 marks)\n\nAnswer all 15 questions. Each question carries 2 marks. Circle the correct answer.\n\n**1.** The document that formally initiates a computer system set-up task is called a:\n\n- (a) Purchase order\n- (b) Job request / work order\n- (c) Delivery note\n- (d) Invoice\n\n**2.** Which of the following is a correct ESD prevention measure?","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":205}}}
