{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017q6WZ5UrdyCwyt19M8GYjY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# KA — IT-020-3:2013-C02 Computer System Maintenance\n2\t\n3\t**Kod:** IT-020-3:2013-C02/KA | **Tahap:** 3 | **Kertas Warna:** Pink\n4\t\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t### Q1 — Types of Maintenance\n8\t**Type:** MCQ | **Difficulty:** L1 | **Marks:** 2 | **LO Ref:** WA1.K1\n9\t\n10\tPreventive maintenance differs from corrective maintenance in that it is:\n11\t\n12\t(a) Unscheduled and triggered by a fault report  (b) Scheduled and performed before failure\n13\t(c) Performed only after warranty expiry  (d) Requested by the user after breakdown\n14\t\n15\t**Answer:** (b)  **Rubric:** 3=Correct+clear explanation | 2=Correct | 1=Partially correct | 0=Wrong\n16\t\n17\t---\n18\t\n19\t### Q2 — Maintenance Tools\n20\t**Type:** MCQ | **Difficulty:** L1 | **Marks:** 2 | **LO Ref:** WA2.K2\n21\t\n22\tWhich tool is used to clean thermal paste from the CPU surface before reapplication?\n23\t\n24\t(a) Compressed air  (b) Soft brush  (c) Isopropyl alcohol with lint-free cloth  (d) Vacuum cleaner\n25\t\n26\t**Answer:** (c)  **Rubric:** 3=Correct+reason | 2=Correct | 1=Partially correct | 0=Wrong\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t### Q3 — Thermal Paste Replacement"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41856400-6278-4fe8-b4e8-d6ce57744942","uuid":"0b9adff4-e315-4d04-9682-78ebb8e3577e","timestamp":"2026-04-17T03:57:06.090Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\it-computer-system\\L3-C02\\KA.md","content":"# KA — IT-020-3:2013-C02 Computer System Maintenance\n\n**Kod:** IT-020-3:2013-C02/KA | **Tahap:** 3 | **Kertas Warna:** Pink\n\n---\n\n### Q1 — Types of Maintenance\n**Type:** MCQ | **Difficulty:** L1 | **Marks:** 2 | **LO Ref:** WA1.K1\n\nPreventive maintenance differs from corrective maintenance in that it is:\n\n(a) Unscheduled and triggered by a fault report  (b) Scheduled and performed before failure\n(c) Performed only after warranty expiry  (d) Requested by the user after breakdown\n\n**Answer:** (b)  **Rubric:** 3=Correct+clear explanation | 2=Correct | 1=Partially correct | 0=Wrong\n\n---\n\n### Q2 — Maintenance Tools\n**Type:** MCQ | **Difficulty:** L1 | **Marks:** 2 | **LO Ref:** WA2.K2\n\nWhich tool is used to clean thermal paste from the CPU surface before reapplication?\n\n(a) Compressed air  (b) Soft brush  (c) Isopropyl alcohol with lint-free cloth  (d) Vacuum cleaner\n\n**Answer:** (c)  **Rubric:** 3=Correct+reason | 2=Correct | 1=Partially correct | 0=Wrong\n\n---\n\n### Q3 — Thermal Paste Replacement","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":66}}}
